WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.410
Same lot size every trade? Then your risk is random.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:10.760
One lot of gold: a hundred ounces. One dollar move, a hundred dollars.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.400
Step one: zero point one lot, ten dollars per dollar.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.630
Step two: Set your risk and stop distance first.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.690
Step three: Fifty divided by five hundred. Zero point one lot.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.150
Mistake: fixed lots. Double the stop, double the risk.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.750
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.190
I show my lot math live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
